{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/e97fd1ef11d7986d10bd72869de3da7a.poster.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/e97fd1ef11d7986d10bd72869de3da7a.webm?t=1761371392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/e97fd1ef11d7986d10bd72869de3da7a.mp4?t=1761371392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/224e1e6840debb2dfe6fa1784ba0db21.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laika, an IRL streamer, didn't find much success after nearly a year of content creation. After an embarrassing accident during one of her streams, her chat went wild, and after a couple of generous donations, she noticed her subscriber count went up!<br><br> With new subscribers needing to be entertained she decided to expand her activities to also post videos, but she needs ideas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/9e6243c12f1b96b9b0e981082082ebcc.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Laika, by managing her day-to-day activities. Brainstorm new ideas by going around the city to find inspiration, make videos, interact with viewers on stream, post pictures for your community to enjoy, and build Laika\u2019s community through her social media!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/5d3d6462ca9fa0cd5689b8b6d6aa758f.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/f1da6ec0a189f6e6bd2ded9d6f313ba3.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/bce58accef74fb71d3bdc78c544edd67.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/extras/5cf086dc9efbb1159c8da7b11fabafc6.avif?t=1761371392\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your sanity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lower Laika\u2019s sanity is the more activities she\u2019s willing to do. How far you ask? Let\u2019s just say there are few things Laika will let stand in the way of her fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Day and night cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make videos during the day, and stream at night, that\u2019s the daily grind of a girl seeking internet fame! Change between day and night to explore the city and encounter many events as Laika becomes more daring with her content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events / Recollection room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laika will encounter many people, from strangers to her fans. Explore the city and hunt down events to progress her streaming journey and enjoy what shenanigans Laika gets up to in her videos and streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prank People for Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance between your chat\u2019s entertainment and the alertness of the people you prank at night. The more you entertain the chat the more donations you\u2019ll get, but the more alert the people you prank are, the greater the chance you\u2019ll get caught and reported to the authorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn and improve your skills\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from The Master and expand your skill tree so you can tackle the challenges of a small time content creator with lofty goals!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mic, camera, live!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304770/606124fa5d8c0a6460f8b270cd36c6bd4512067f.jpg"},{"name":"Loved by all!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304770/52dc5a50c58c6e660d385dd2f0d0ae379e591172.jpg"},{"name":"Disciple of the Stream I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304770/ee3786a19d15f2c59580ecb1733297e3a5cdb21f.jpg"},{"name":"Disciple of the Stream II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304770/5e4aaed48768a55c947fff4b34ca407cdf4a9481.jpg"},{"name":"Disciple of the Stream III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3304770/b04e5a320491a9bb74f6358b0618cc15b8944435.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304770?t=1761371392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761371392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams