 Laika will let stand in the way of her fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Day and night cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make videos during the day, and stream at night, that\u2019s the daily grind of a girl seeking internet fame! Change between day and night to explore the city and encounter many events as Laika becomes more daring with her content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events / Recollection room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laika will encounter many people, from strangers to her fans. Explore the city and hunt down events to progress her streaming journey and enjoy what shenanigans Laika gets up to in her videos and streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prank People for Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance between your chat\u2019s entertainment and the alertness of the people you prank at night. The more you entertain the chat the more donations you\u2019ll get, but the more alert the people you prank are, the greater the chance you\u2019ll get caught and reported to the authorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn and improve your skills\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from The Master and expand your skill tree so you can tackle the challenges of a small time content creator with lofty goals!</p>","developers":["Kumada Gaon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304770/header.jpg?t=1761371392","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304770/829060/ebf0460a06c6632f9068022303198f9a241157ca/1750825425/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740882764","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304770